### Create Learner
POST http://localhost:8080/api/learners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Palak",
  "email": "palak@example.com",
  "experienceLevel": "Intermediate",
  "careerGoal": "Java Full Stack Developer",
  "interests": "Backend, Web Development, AI",
  "currentSkills": "Java, SQL, HTML, CSS",
  "weeklyLearningHours": 10,
  "targetDurationMonths": 6
}
### Get All Learners
GET http://localhost:8080/api/learners
### Get Learner By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/learners/1

### Generate Learning Path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/learning-path/generate/1

### Skill Gap Analysis
GET http://localhost:8080/api/skill-gap/1

### Get Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations/1

### Get Progress
GET http://localhost:8080/api/progress/1

### Mark Topic Completed
POST http://localhost:8080/api/progress/1?topic=Spring%20Boot&completed=true